{"slug": "musha_mushi", "title": "ମୂଷା ଓ ମୁଷୀ", "total": 50, "landing": "/shishu/e_library-musha_mushi-html.html", "pages": [{"src": "/media/45ff3447605ee593efe1fdbf.jpg", "text": null, "kind": null, "page": 1, "width": 1656, "height": 2610}, {"src": "/media/333e3ec606d01af9e973fbf4.jpg", "text": null, "kind": null, "page": 2, "width": 1371, "height": 1851}, {"src": "/media/7a0305557d189ecbdd9b55a9.jpg", "text": null, "kind": null, "page": 3, "width": 1371, "height": 1851}, {"src": "/media/6389d6c28896d12e6f463db6.jpg", "text": null, "kind": null, "page": 4, "width": 1371, "height": 1851}, {"src": "/media/eda792edcda188f8de044c60.jpg", "text": null, "kind": null, "page": 5, "width": 1371, "height": 1851}, {"src": "/media/292af442fbaaf3e8c54ee1c9.jpg", "text": null, "kind": null, "page": 6, "width": 1371, "height": 1851}, {"src": "/media/63073d6dcd71b21d455204ac.jpg", "text": null, "kind": null, "page": 7, "width": 1371, "height": 1851}, {"src": "/media/46a4a0660c04a1c19a80ffd7.jpg", "text": "ମୂଷା ମୂଷୀ ଗଲେ ମେଳଣ ଦେଖି\n\nମୂଷାମୂଷୀ ଗଲେ ମେଳଣ ଦେଖି\nମେଳଣରେ ଭାରି ଭିଡ଼।\nବିଲେଇ କରିଛି ମିଠାଦୋକାନ\nନେଉଳ ବିକେ ପଇଡ଼ ॥\nସାପ ଛାଣେ ବସି ବରା ପକୁଡ଼ି\nଗୋଧି ବିକେ ସରବତ ।\nବେଲୁନ୍ ବିକୁଛି ଡାମରାକୁଆ\nଚିଲ ଗାଉଅଛି ଗୀତ ॥\nକୁକୁର ଡାକୁଛି ଭୋ ଭୋ କରି\nଆମ ଦୋକାନକୁ ଆସ ।\nଆମ ଦୋକାନରେ ମିଳୁଛି ଲଡୁ\nଦି’ ଟଙ୍କାକୁ ପୂରା ଦଶ ॥\nମୟୂର ବିକୁଛି ପନିପରିବା\nପରିବାରେ ପୋକ ନାହିଁ ।\nକୋଉଠି କଦବା ଦିଶିଲେ ପୋକ\nଖୁମ୍ପମାରି ଦିଏ ଖାଇ ॥", "kind": "verse", "page": 8, "width": 1371, "height": 1851}, {"src": "/media/21d5c9f38734a7baa8e216d7.jpg", "text": null, "kind": null, "page": 9, "width": 1371, "height": 1851}, {"src": "/media/e83c6243e3d0d414a005893a.jpg", "text": null, "kind": null, "page": 10, "width": 1371, "height": 1851}, {"src": "/media/acb268d5bf78729749a30490.jpg", "text": null, "kind": null, "page": 11, "width": 4111, "height": 5552}, {"src": "/media/a112f5d0ef7f0881917c11f9.jpg", "text": null, "kind": null, "page": 12, "width": 1371, "height": 1851}, {"src": "/media/c08b67dd4bb68f159578fad0.jpg", "text": null, "kind": null, "page": 13, 